    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPERIENCE HIGH OCTANE KARTING... ON PC?!?!</h2>Are you SICK AND TIRED of certain companies not putting fun kart games on PC? Are you also tired of trying to mod tracks and racers into some emulator only for said company to try and destroy the emulator? Or, if you've answered &quot;no&quot; to either of those, do you wanna shoot your roommate in the back of the head with a missile? I (the developer) have solved all of these problems and more!!!<br><br>Play the most customizable Kart game this side (either side) of the Mississippi!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890560/extras/65199aa77066ed4689164c4b42a75414.poster.avif?t=1749071624\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890560/extras/65199aa77066ed4689164c4b42a75414.webm?t=1749071624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890560/extras/65199aa77066ed4689164c4b42a75414.mp4?t=1749071624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2>You read it right! This game has <strong>features!</strong> Including...<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Online multiplayer!<br></li><li>Original tracks &amp; racers!<br></li><li>Modded tracks &amp; racers via Steam Workshop!<br></li><li>High speed action with various items!<br></li><li>Accessible SDK for custom content development!<br></li><li>Original soundtrack (by me, the developer!)</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPERIENCE HIGH OCTANE KARTING... ON PC?!?!</h2>Are you SICK AND TIRED of certain companies not putting fun kart games on PC? Are you also tired of trying to mod tracks and racers into some emulator only for said company to try and destroy the emulator? Or, if you've answered &quot;no&quot; to either of those, do you wanna shoot your roommate in the back of the head with a missile? I (the developer) have solved all of these problems and more!!!<br><br>Play the most customizable Kart game this side (either side) of the Mississippi!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890560/extras/65199aa77066ed4689164c4b42a75414.poster.avif?t=1749071624\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890560/extras/65199aa77066ed4689164c4b42a75414.webm?t=1749071624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890560/extras/65199aa77066ed4689164c4b42a75414.mp4?t=1749071624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2>You read it right! This game has <strong>features!</strong> Including...<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Online multiplayer!<br></li><li>Original tracks &amp; racers!<br></li><li>Modded tracks &amp; racers via Steam Workshop!<br></li><li>High speed action with various items!<br></li><li>Accessible SDK for custom content development!<br></li><li>Original soundtrack (by me, the developer!)</li></ul>",
